      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu baKiriatsi-yearimu nibeetsa nibeenda lisanduku liOMWAMI, nibaliinjisia munzu yaAbinadabu, eyali khushikulu; nibaahula Eleazari omwanawe, alilindenje lisanduku liOMWAMI.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samweli yayaasia Isiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne okhurula khunyanga eyo eya lisanduku liamenya muKiriatsi-yearimu, shiali eshise eshirambi; okhuba shiali eshiemiyika amakhumi kabili; bosi abeinzu yaIsiraeli nibamwikhuulila OMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Samweli nasunjila bosi abeinzu yaIsiraeli, ari Nimuba nimukalushila OMWAMI nende omwoyo kweenywe kwosi, kho murusieho abanyasaye abacheni nende abaAshitarotsi, barule mwinywe, nimwikhwanilia OMWAMI emioyo chieenywe, nimumukhalabanila ye yenyene; naye alamuhonia mumukhono kwabaFilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaIsiraeli nibarusiaho emiBaali nende emiAshitarotsi, nibakhalabanila OMWAMI yenyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli naboola mbu Mukhung'aanie abaIsiraeli bosi eMizipa, nasi ndalamusaayila khuMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakhung'aana halala eMizipa, nibataha amatsi, nibakatsukha imbeli wOMWAMI, nibahonga inzala khunyanga eyo, nibaboolayo bari Khwamwonoonela OMWAMI. Naye Samweli nayaasia abaIsiraeli eMizipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa abaFilisiti bahulila shinga abaIsiraeli olwa bali nibakhung'aanile halala eMizipa, abaami babaFilisiti batikulukha okhuseera Isiraeli. Nolwa abaIsiraeli bahulilakhwo, baria abaFilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaIsiraeli nibamusunjila Samweli bari Oralekhakhwo okhukhuhaabilila khuMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe ta, mbu akhuhonie mumukhono kwabaFilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Samweli yabukula eshimeeme eshishinuuna, nashimala shibe omusango omusambe omulamba kwOMWAMI; khandi Samweli yahaabila OMWAMI khulwa Isiraeli; OMWAMI naye namukalusiamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa Samweli yali namalanga omusango omusambe, abaFilisiti basita ahambi okhuseera Isiraeli; ne OMWAMI yabakukumilakhwo abaFilisiti nende oluyoka olukhongo, nabakoyaasia; nabo nibarootswa imbeli waIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu baIsiraeli nibarula eMizipa, nibalondachilila abaFilisiti, nibabarootsa, okhuula olwa boola mundaalila yeBetsekari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Samweli nabukula lichina, nalisinjisia hakari waMizipa nende Yeshana, nalikulikha eliira mbu Ebenezeri, nasunga ari Okhuula bulaano OMWAMI yakhukhoonyilenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindio abaFilisiti bahulwa, nibareenjila khandi munzakho tsiaIsiraeli ta; khandi omukhono kwOMWAMI kwayinga abaFilisiti mundaalo tsiosi tsiaSamweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata amataala aka abaFilisiti bali nibabukuule muIsiraeli, Isiraeli yakalusia, okhurula eEkeroni okhuula eGatsi; Isiraeli nahonia eshialoshie mumukhono kwabaFilisiti. Khandi omulembe nikubaho hakari waIsiraeli nende abaAmori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli nayaasia Isiraeli tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobuyindifubwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omuyika buli muyika yali nabotokhananga natsia eBeteli, nende eGiligali, nende eMizipa; nayaasia Isiraeli mubundu yumo mwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yakalukhanga eRama, okhuba neyo ewa inzuye yali; nayaasia Isiraeli ebweneyo; niyoombashilayo OMWAMI eshimalilo shiemisango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
